        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Two storey semi-detached residence extending to 121 sq. m (1,309 sq. ft.) which contains entrance hall,\r\nliving room, dining room, kitchen and bathroom on ground floor with four bedrooms and wc on first floor.\r\nGarage (5.84 x 3.10) and coal shed (4.48 x 3.58) at the rear. Rear vehicular entrance to large garden and\r\npedestrian side entrance from Brews Hill."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "BER Details; BER G \r\nServices\r\nMains water and Sewerage Electric storage heating.\r\nFixtures & Fittings\r\nProperty sold as seen"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Superbly located Four Bed Residence In Need of Renovation With Large Rear Garden with Rear Vehicular Access, Garage & Coal Shed\r\n- Ideal Family Home or Investment Opportunity.\r\n- Zoned M2 Mixed Use - City/Town/village Centre, central"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Eircode: C15A2H2\r\n\r\n30 Brews Hill is located conveniently to every conceivable amenity. There are a host of leisure amenities\r\n- pubs and restaurants aplenty. Navan Library is closeby alongside the newly opened Meath Arts Centre\r\nwhere there is something for everyone; musicals, drama, stand-up comedy, art exhibitions – the list is endless.\r\nNavan Town has several primary & secondary schools and Our Lady’s Hospital, is moments away. Aldi\r\nSupermarket and Pairc Tailteann are located across from the property.\r\nThis residence enjoys easy access to R147 (Cavan - Navan- Dublin Road), resulting in easy commuting to\r\nall parts of Dublin City via the M3. Dublin City and Airport c. 44km. For those using public transport, CIE\r\nprovide an excellent commuter service between Navan & Dublin City Centre. The nearest 109 & 109X bus\r\nstop is 20 minute walk from the property (‘Navan, Abbey Road’), with buses to Dublin regularly starting from\r\n5.35am – 10.35pm daily. The NX also runs every 20 minutes daily from 5.40am – 12.30pm with the stop\r\nlocated only 10 minute walk from the property (‘Navan, Abbey Road’). The 109A runs a 24hour service to\r\nDublin Airport with the stop (‘Navan, Opp Fire Station’) being a 15 minute walk from the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Viewing strictly by appointment only.\r\n\r\nAll viewings by sole selling agents Smith Harrington Chartered Surveyors.\r\nTel: 046 9021113 Email info@smithharrington.ie - 8/9 Bridge Street, Navan, Co Meath C15 F386."
      }
